{
  "id": "DEU.30",
  "number": "30",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 30",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "30",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 30"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "30",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gichea eebiikteayda eanyasta ghawooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas ghapka badaydaang'u haleanjeeni seaniin, was ghawooda ea mooshteayda, ghayi aayiinyi madeadaang'u, ak giguursi saawa ghoapkaat aba bugusta eemooji bea heeda jea ghwayiinyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak inyas giyamsi geaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ang'iing'i ea diibigaagu, ak giileeysiit ghuutaanyi aba gidarukuneey sean askweareani, aba gurooroadaang'u ea aba jeadaang'u sean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygoodeelseey jeeda miyeenoadaang'u, ak ghabwaydaneey, nea gabiikta gicha ghoawaam aba jeeda buuneesean, heeda ghayi adearseey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fugaagu dardaawaat mida murdajeega ng'eanyiida ak aba hoowa gaygooweamneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak aba hoowa gaygweaneey; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygweaneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi ambal ghweanigeagwa, ak gajambala ak gayghwanung' miyeena nea ghwasaang'ayiit jeataang'u ea naawana ghweanigaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygooyiil gurooroadaang'u NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ea guroorooda jeacheengaagu, ak gaybwariinya NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba gurooroadaang'u sean ea aba jeadaang'u sean, ak ginyasi eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U mooshteayeeksu badayda fuga sinyi ea weajoodigaagu ea gea sawanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gajaleeysiina iit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA, nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi sean earukuneey askweareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygooheaneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U haleanjeeda sean bea gadiyeeda geatindaang'u, ea aba jeataang'u, ea aba jeata dugwaagu, ea aba haghweega ng'eanyiidaang'u, ak gaygahoosan NG'UTAMIIDA aba badaydaang'u aba ng'asheega miyaas, gawuurji gidaghayi hoosanda aba ghweanigaagu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyas giileeysiit ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi ea ng'asheega rukuneey, ghayi sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani bea deaweedean, inyas giyamsi geaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba gurooroadaang'u sean ea aba jeadaang'u sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba diigheanji earukuneey askweareaniin mii hang'waay aba headaang'u nea mii sheagi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda humng'eeda, ak gajeena, ‘Gaygwadiyeada ng'eaha aba heedeanya gawa humng'eeda, ak gweaneasa, ak geayiinyi ak geesinyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mii gideaba gwanda giigheawda basooda gil, ak gajeena, ‘Gayghoaghaawa ng'eaha basooda aba badahuukaasa, ak gweaneasa, ak geayiinyi ak geesinyi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ng'asheanda ea neekeeweey muuchi, ak gwanda ghuutaang'u, ea gurooroadaang'u, abeeda gisini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Daaha, naayiinyi madeadaang'u askweareani eaweega ea gea miyaas, miyeeda ea gea munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas giing'waanyi digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U earukuneey askweareani, nea gibwariinyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea giyaadi naweadingaaschi, aba ging'ooyda diigheanyeekaaschi ea deaweedajeagaaschi ea girgweaguutkaachi, abeeda gaynyasa giibinda nea gisaang'ayiidi, ak gaygagoonyi ghawooda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U aba jeeda ng'eanyiida uwi jeeda jea ambala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas ghwayam geaw gurooroadaang'u, ak ea miyiing'sheeni, nea guwi bwada aseecheeka suuk, nea gigadiyeesi saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gearukuneegwa eaweecheanji, gideaba gajooshealana, nea majoopiidana giligeaw ng'eanyiida ghamneawa ooweayi nea ghoakghaawi Yordani ak goombali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaguursi humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida ghoah muwshoocheanda aba badahuukeagwa askweareani, ak ea naayiinyi madeadaang'u eaweega ea miyeeda, ghawooda ea mooshteayda, asi loada eaweega, ak abeeda ang'iing'i ea jeacheengaagu gajanyasa giibinda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwariinya NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, aleeysiina iit ghuutaanyi, ak giing'waanyi niny aba gideaba nih eaweagaagu, ea geawunda askwearjoojigaagu, ak goopiidi jeeda ng'eanyiida ghayi aksa NG'UTAMIIDA habeawooda aba badayda ghweanigaagu, was Abrahamu, ea Isaka, ea Yakobo, gideaba gayghoadaw saawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
